# Root build context: the uv workspace needs every member's metadata to validate,
# but caches, tests and non-build assets are pruned.
**/.venv/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/.mypy_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/tests/
.git/
.idea/
.vscode/
docs/
k8s/
scripts/
*.enc
*.sig
*.key
*.pem
model_cache/
var/
